        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the 17th century Caribbean with this old-school turn-based strategy, and take the wheel as Captain George Somers, James Riskinner or Joseph Bannister, three historical figures during the Golden Age of Piracy in the Caribbean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story is based at a different time, in a different settlement.  Perform missions to upgrade your crew and assemble your fleet, and complete their historical accomplishments.   Missions pit you against enemy vessels, ports and strongholds in pursuit of gold and plunder.  Command up to four ships and engage in ship-vs-ship battles and crew-to-crew turn based combat with your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George Somers faces the challenges of preparing a new ship for an arduous journey to finally deliver supplies and settlers to Jamestown, ten months after a  hurricane left him marooned in Bermuda.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James Riskinner seeks to amass a fortune in Spanish gold and goods, taken by force, or you'll die trying.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Joseph Bannister committed treachery against Britain and then sailed with a group of Dutch privateers to raid the Spanish port of Campeche</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/cb33aa696a2c0a235ec519d695f9fa22.poster.avif?t=1767467990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/cb33aa696a2c0a235ec519d695f9fa22.webm?t=1767467990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/cb33aa696a2c0a235ec519d695f9fa22.mp4?t=1767467990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the 17th century Caribbean with this old-school turn-based strategy, and take the wheel as Captain George Somers, James Riskinner or Joseph Bannister, three historical figures during the Golden Age of Piracy in the Caribbean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story is based at a different time, in a different settlement.  Perform missions to upgrade your crew and assemble your fleet, and complete their historical accomplishments.   Missions pit you against enemy vessels, ports and strongholds in pursuit of gold and plunder.  Command up to four ships and engage in ship-vs-ship battles and crew-to-crew turn based combat with your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George Somers faces the challenges of preparing a new ship for an arduous journey to finally deliver supplies and settlers to Jamestown, ten months after a  hurricane left him marooned in Bermuda.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James Riskinner seeks to amass a fortune in Spanish gold and goods, taken by force, or you'll die trying.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Joseph Bannister committed treachery against Britain and then sailed with a group of Dutch privateers to raid the Spanish port of Campeche</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/cb33aa696a2c0a235ec519d695f9fa22.poster.avif?t=1767467990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/cb33aa696a2c0a235ec519d695f9fa22.webm?t=1767467990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras